{
  "id": "34035_ayabumu",
  "headword": "{危|あや}ぶむ",
  "reading": "あやぶむ",
  "romaji": "ayabumu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to fear for; to doubt (that something will succeed)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to fear for; to doubt (that something will succeed)",
      "explanation": "To be worried that something may not turn out well, or to doubt whether it will happen at all. A written word, used most often in the passive, as in news reports."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "34035_ayabumu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{開催|かいさい}→開催：10457_kaisai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{危|あや}ぶまれる。",
      "english": "There are doubts that the event will go ahead.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34035_ayabumu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{台風|たいふう}→台風：01455_taifuu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{試合|しあい}→試合：01601_shiai⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{開催|かいさい}→開催：10457_kaisai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{危|あや}ぶまれて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "Because of the typhoon, it is doubtful whether the match will be held.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34035_ayabumu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{周囲|しゅうい}→周囲：03206_shuui⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{危|あや}ぶむ⟦{中|なか}→中：00654_naka⟧、⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{一人|ひとり}→一人：00630_hitori⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{進|すす}めた→進める：01949_susumeru⟧。",
      "english": "While those around him doubted it would succeed, he pressed on with the plan alone.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Related to ⟦{危|あぶ}ない→危ない：00768_abunai⟧ but formal and written. The passive {危|あや}ぶまれる (to be in doubt) is the commonest form: ⟦{存続|そんぞく}→存続：12242_sonzoku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{危|あや}ぶまれる (its survival is in doubt).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{危|あや}ぶむ.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{心配|しんぱい}する→心配する：06066_shinpaisuru⟧: to worry, the everyday word\n- ⟦{危惧|きぐ}→危惧：11862_kigu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to fear, to be apprehensive — formal, for serious risks",
